{"step_index":1128,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:45:38Z","thinking":"**Analyzing CSS Styles**\n\nI've been examining the CSS, specifically `style.css`. I noted some key styles. For `.activity-container`, there's padding set at 4px, 16px, 8px, and 16px. Also, the `.activity-intro-view` has `max-width: 800px;` and `height: 90%;`. Finally, `.level1-room-scene` has specific `max-width` and `height` attributes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Khóa cố định kích thước 860px x 88% cho toàn bộ 13 màn chơi và Intro để chấm dứt hiện tượng khung hoạt động bị nhảy","EndLine":485,"Instruction":"Chuẩn hóa kích thước khung hình cho tất cả các view","ReplacementContent":"/* MÀN GIỚI THIỆU HOẠT ĐỘNG (INTRO VIEW) - KHÓA KÍCH THƯỚC CHUẨN */\n.activity-intro-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: 88%;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 14px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.intro-header-badge {\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: #0288D1;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 3px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    border: 2px solid #B3E5FC;\n}\n\n.intro-activity-title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #E65100;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 660px;\n    height: 240px;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    border: 2px solid #FFF;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #FFF;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.intro-prompt-quote {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #37474F;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n.activity-gameplay-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 1: PHÒNG NGỦ BÉ BIN (P0.3 - BIN ĐỨNG TRỰC TIẾP TRÊN NỀN PHÒNG)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.level1-room-scene {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: 88%;\n    position: relative;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 0 0 4px #FFFFFF;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 16px 36px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n/* Kệ tủ đồ bên trái */\n.room-wardrobe-grid {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item {\n    min-height: 78px;\n    min-width: 105px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 3px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04); }\n.clothes-tile-item:active { transform: scale(1.12); }\n.clothes-tile-item.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n    border-color: #E75B52 !important;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item img {\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item span {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trên sàn phòng ngủ */\n.room-bin-character-mount {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 380px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    background: transparent !important;\n    border: none !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n    z-index: 10;\n    margin-right: 30px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n\n.bin-sprite-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.16));\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   UNIFIED SCENE ART STAGE (CHUẨN 860px x 88%)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.unified-scene-stage {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: 88%;\n    position: relative;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 0 0 4px #FFFFFF;\n    background: #000;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}","StartLine":295,"TargetContent":"/* MÀN GIỚI THIỆU HOẠT ĐỘNG (INTRO VIEW) */\n.activity-intro-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    height: 90%;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justif